commit e9a037e8c8f2d932724528812c2742d1efc6994f
Author: Christoph Kieslich <c.kieslich@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 6 15:27:07 2026 +0000

    fix(worker): gate OAuth /mcp to POST and show the redirect host on consent

    - With OAuth enabled, GET /mcp opened an idle SSE stream after a Hevy key
      check, DELETE returned 200 and /mcp/<anything> served MCP. The OAuth path
      now matches the legacy one: 405 with Allow: POST, OPTIONS before any Hevy
      call, and 404 off the exact /mcp path.
    - Dynamic client registration is open, so the consent page now shows the
      host the authorization code will be sent to and marks the client name as
      self-asserted, making a look-alike "Claude" client visible.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M6RQK7EBH4TS1BSRXVQM0M86

